1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,580
This is Unspar.

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:05,600
It writes articles for your website,
like blog posts and guides.

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,860
First, you tell it what to write about.

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:12,630
Paste your website, choose what
you want to make and add a topic.

5
00:00:12,955 --> 00:00:16,085
Unspar looks at your site
and drafts a few ideas.

6
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,973
A moment later,
you have ideas to choose from.

7
00:00:20,198 --> 00:00:21,488
You pick the one you like.

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,860
Before anything runs,
you see what it costs.

9
00:00:25,325 --> 00:00:28,775
When you queue it, the credits
are set aside and the work starts.

10
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:32,033
Then its AI agents get to work.

11
00:00:32,313 --> 00:00:36,383
They look up the topic, write the article
in your voice and check the facts.

12
00:00:37,517 --> 00:00:39,747
You decide what that voice sounds like.

13
00:00:39,902 --> 00:00:42,992
Pick how formal it is and
how the sentences flow.

14
00:00:44,083 --> 00:00:46,913
When you're happy with it,
Unspar puts it on your site.

15
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:49,003
It works with WordPress and Ghost.

16
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:51,020
Unspar.

17
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,410
Content that doesn't read like AI.

18
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:56,370
Try it for free at unspar.com.

